  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Servo Ports Pin Definition"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Please strictly follow the wire sequence below to avoid damaging the components.​"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Introduction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The 9G Servo Motor with Clutch Protection is a high-performance servo product, designed for mechanical control."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "High Precision Motion Control: Equipped with advanced digital control technology, the 9G Servo Motor with Clutch Protection can provide precise motion control, ensuring stable and accurate actions for models or mechanical devices."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Clutch Function: Unlike traditional servos, this servo has a clutch function to prevent overload damage. (Note: When external forces change the angle of the servo during normal operation, the servo can protect itself from damage through the integrated clutch mechanism. This function automatically resets and restores the servo to prevent any potential hazards)"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Powerful Torque Output: Despite its compact size, the servo has excellent torque output capability. It can drive larger loads making it suitable for various applications requiring strong driving force."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Fast Response: With a quick response speed, it can rapidly respond to control signals, achieving fast and precise actions, enhancing the response speed and performance of models or devices."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Digital Control: Utilizing digital control, it offers stability and reliability, allowing for fine-tuning through programming to meet the needs of different application scenarios."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Wide Applicability: Suitable for various fields such as models, robots, remote-controlled vehicles, and aeromodelling, providing reliable power support for various creative and application needs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Considerations"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "When installing the servo, ensure that it is correctly matched with the mechanical structure of the model or device to avoid excessive stress or unstable installation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Use a power supply that meets the specifications to avoid damage to the servo due to excessive or insufficient voltage."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Avoid overloading the servo to prevent damage to internal components or the motor."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "When using the clutch function, operate gently to avoid excessive force and protect the internal mechanical structure and circuitry of the servo."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "When manually operating the clutch function, avoid excessive rotation of the servo to prevent damage to internal components or mechanical structures."
    }
  ],
